<title>USA: Morningstar stake held by Vinik group.</title>
<headline>Morningstar stake held by Vinik group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by former Magellan Fund manager Jeffery Vinik said Friday it holds a 6.5 percent stake in Morningstar Group Inc or 987,500 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought the stake between Nov 1 and Dec 12 at prices ranging from $16.6125 to $18.4750 per share.</p>
<p>The group holds the stake in the Dallas-based refrigerated food products manufacturer for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
